ssApproval, the only exposure field the file carries). It is a proxy, not a workout LGD.","es":"Proxy de LGD = monto bruto castigado sobre el monto bruto aprobado (campos SBA 7(a) GrossChargeOffAmount y GrossApproval, el único campo de exposición del archivo). Es un proxy, no una LGD de recuperación."},"formula":"GrossChargeOffAmount / GrossApproval","source_field":"GrossChargeOffAmount","exposure_field":"GrossApproval","recovery_cash_flows_available":false,"bias_direction":"downward","bias_statement":{"en":"The proxy is biased low: the approved amount overstates the exposure at default of an amortising loan, so the denominator is too large. A second effect pushes the other way: the SBA 7(a) public file has no recovery cash flows after charge-off, so the proxy ignores recoveries and costs and overstates the loss net of recoveries; it can also exceed 1 when capitalised interest or fees are charged off. The stated direction is the denominator effect (decision D2).","es":"El proxy tiene sesgo a la baja: el monto aprobado sobreestima la exposición al incumplimiento de un credito que se amortiza, de modo que el denominador es demasiado grande. Un segundo efecto va en sentido contrario: el archivo público SBA 7(a) no tiene flujos de recuperación posteriores al castigo, de modo que el proxy ignora recuperaciones y costos y sobreestima la pérdida neta de recuperaciones; también puede superar 1 si se castigan intereses capitalizados o comisiones. La dirección declarada es el efecto del denominador (decisión D2)."}},"data_status":{"primary_source":"sba-7a-chargeoff-twin","freddie_mac_available":false,"freddie_mac_reason":"Freddie Mac: the owner's account is missing; the SBA twin is published","notice":{"en":"Small-business loans, not mortgages: the SBA 7(a) charge-offs are the public twin of the mortgage case. Freddie Mac's data is not used (the owner's account is missing). The LGD is a proxy: the file has no recovery cash flows after the charge-off.","es":"Préstamos a pequeñas empresas, no hipotecas: los castigos SBA 7(a) son el gemelo público del caso hipotecario. No se usan los datos de Freddie Mac (falta la cuenta del propietario). La LGD es un proxy: el archivo no tiene flujos de recuperación posteriores al castigo."}},"cohorts":[{"id":"2003-06","label":{"en":"Defaults 2003-06","es":"Incumplimientos 2003-06"},"first_year":2003,"last_year":2006},{"id":"2007-08","label":{"en":"Defaults 2007-08","es":"Incumplimientos 2007-08"},"first_year":2007,"last_year":2008},{"id":"2009-10","label":{"en":"Defaults 2009-10","es":"Incumplimientos 2009-10"},"first_year":2009,"last_year":2010},{"id":"2011-13","label":{"en":"Defaults 2011-13","es":"Incumplimientos 2011-13"},"first_year":2011,"last_year":2013},{"id":"2014-19","label":{"en":"Defaults 2014-19","es":"Incumplimientos 2014-19"},"first_year":2014,"last_year":2019},{"id":"2020-23","label":{"en":"Defaults 2020-23","es":"Incumplimientos 2020-23"},"first_year":2020,"last_year":2023}],"training":{"cutoff_date":"2006-12-31","n_defaults":48833,"n_open_workouts_excluded":7388,"closure_rule":{"en":"Only defaults whose charge-off closed strictly before the cutoff enter the training set (the file has no later record of a workout); later default cohorts are the tests. The file has no default date before the charge-off, so the open workouts excluded are counted as the charge-offs of the 12 months after the cutoff, a stated stand-in.","es":"Solo entran al entrenamiento los incumplimientos cuyo castigo cerro estrictamente antes del corte (el archivo no tiene registro posterior de una recuperación); las cohortes posteriores son de prueba. El archivo no tiene fecha de incumplimiento anterior al castigo, de modo que los procesos abiertos excluidos se cuentan como los castigos de los 12 meses posteriores al corte, un sustituto declarado."}},"workout":{"discount_rate_convention":"none-proxy","discount_rate":null,"incomplete_workouts":{"treatment":"not-applicable","n_excluded":0,"n_projected":0,"reason":"the SBA 